ph","text":"2025年、\nどんな自分に出会えるのかな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"怖がることなく\n何に対しても飛び込んでみようと思います"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よかったら、見守っていてね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では。よいお年をお迎えください❄️❄️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなで紅白みるぞ！！☺️"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-7110":{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"PARCO劇場の公演では沢山成長させて頂きました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結果は残念だったけど、自分の大きな糧になりました！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これをバネにして、大きく一歩ずつ前に進みます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は、少し悔いがあります！\n    やっぱり２幕に立ちたかった！\n立って、見てもらいたかった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、今の自分が今の精一杯の努力、実力でした。\n１幕で出しきりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだ成長していきたいです！"},{"type":"image","src":"