s/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しかったでーす"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3．3．7拍子では手をたたいてくださってThank Youです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんとーにビックリしました！涙"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、これないけど応援してくださってた皆様...\n皆様がいてくれたから、勇気とパワーが湧いて来ました。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとうございました\nどんなに心強かったか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"感謝の気持ちでいっぱいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも、初心を忘れず向上心でがんばりまぁやー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやん＋まあや=まあやん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハイ！黙ります"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photo